id: pm-slack-standup-74w8
title: Certify pm-slack-standup on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "Upgrade exact @unbrained/pm-cli, pm-ops, and pm-changelog pins with lockfile; verify package tracker, full release gate, packed npm and Bun behavior, current OIDC release path, and PR reviews."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[4]: certification,cli,release,sdk
created_at: "2026-09-28T21:11:27.527Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T12:15:29.214Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: Exact pins and lockfile use latest published versions; full release gate and tracker strict health pass; packed Node/npm and Bun real-command acceptance pass; GitHub checks and review state are recorded for the exact pushed head.
actual_result: "Review-corrected full locked npm run release:check PASS: 208/208 tests, zero skips; canonical launcher scoped/linked 8/8; duplication 0/8790 lines across 26 sources; 81 documented declarations; canonical-reader and all 5 packed npm/Bun current/minimum/global scenarios PASS. Coverage unchanged at 90.44/88.23/91.79 across index.ts only; scripts and independent statements remain unmeasured in pm-slack-standup-7t31. Production audit/pack/changelog/date/attestation PASS; full audit remains 4 high unpatched braces findings in pm-slack-standup-2sjh. Original real-tracker packed npm/native Bun dogfood PASS: 89 input items, same section data, byte-identical 3175-byte Markdown, scratch deleted. Strict health PASS with unchanged advisories. pm-github 2026.10.4 installed locally, zero-case read-only preview 0/0/0; runtime payload excluded from Git, reviewed upstream apply limitations recorded in pm-slack-standup-bhg0. All pins exact; alerts []. NOT READY for audit/coverage requirements; final-head CI and substantive bot reviews remain separate."
comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T18:25:02.591Z",pi-land-a,"Merge-readiness verification pass by pi-land-a (fleet PR landing session): exact head 919fc0a is up to date with origin/main (merge-base equals main tip), mergeable and CLEAN; Node 22, Node 26, CodeQL, Windows packed acceptance, Greptile, Semgrep and Hound CI are green; all five review threads are resolved; Greptile passed on this head. CodeRabbit's prior full-review requests for this head were rate limited, so the review window was re-requested. Sourcery budget exhausted (quota notice, not a review); Gemini not active. The all-source coverage blocker remains separately open under pm-slack-standup-7t31."
  "2026-10-02T23:44:57.045Z",codex-sol,"Restart codex-sol: preserving all four retained PM files from stopped pi-grok agent, including actual_result 207 correction and technical note refusal. Rebase autostash restored the retained edits; current main already incorporated. JSONL prefixes stay unchanged. Revalidate full release gate/strict CI health/Bun and committed dist. Mutable-note contract supports edit/delete; preserve earlier events. Existing terminal release incident items are retained without new closures."
  "2026-10-02T23:48:08.196Z",codex-sol,"First full gate failed one existing fallback fixture because a shared temporary ancestor now has a PM binary. Scoped test failed before the fix. Resolver intentionally probes four ancestors; changed only the fixture to own all four searched directories and place a real shim just outside the bound. This deterministically verifies PATH fallback and bounded search without reading/modifying other workspaces. Scoped test passes; no production code, skips or thresholds changed. Rerunning full gate."
  "2026-10-03T00:00:46.566Z",codex-sol,"npm ci and npm run release:check PASS: 207/207 tests, zero skipped; measured index.ts coverage 90.44/88.23/91.79 lines/branches/functions with unchanged 83/87/87 floors; 81 documented declarations. Independent statements, whole-source 100 percent, mutation and broader static/security acceptance remain unmeasured/unaccepted in pm-slack-standup-7t31. Canonical-reader acceptance and all five packed npm/Bun current/minimum/global scenarios pass. Audit all/production zero; strict CI health, pm validate, Bun install and CI fresh-dist comparison pass. Linked packaging tests pass 2/2 and focused PATH fallback test 1/1 passes after failing red on a populated temporary ancestor. The fixture now owns all four searched directories and a shim just outside the bound, preserving real fallback assertions without touching other workspaces. Retained 207 count correction and original 206 history event preserved; all JSONL prefixes unchanged. Note projections support edit/delete in pinned CLI; immutable history is retained. Final-head CI and substantive reviews remain separate; both items released in_progress, never closed."
  "2026-10-04T11:24:44.035Z",codex-sol,"Isolated worktree certification: consolidate Dependabot #98/#99/#100/#102/#103, exact published development pins, canonical launcher, existing full gate, real-tracker dry-run dogfood with npm and native Bun, managed read-only GitHub preview. Preserve all coverage thresholds and record any remaining real coverage gap on pm-slack-standup-7t31. No Slack delivery, GitHub writes, merge or publishing."
  "2026-10-04T11:38:03.096Z",codex-sol,"Security blocker verified: npm audit --omit=dev is clean, but full npm audit reports 4 high findings (braces/micromatch/fast-glob/pm-ops) for GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm. Registry latest braces is 3.0.3, and the reviewed advisory explicitly lists patched versions: None. Latest fast-glob 3.3.3 and micromatch 4.0.8 retain this chain. The suggested pm-ops downgrade violates the required latest canonical gate and does not justify audit-clean certification. Full audit remains a NOT READY gate; continue unchanged functional/CI gates and record a package-owned remediation follow-up."
  "2026-10-04T11:44:56.720Z",codex-sol,"Functional/CI gates and real-tracker dogfood pass; full development audit has 4 high unpatched braces findings, with coverage gap unchanged. Evidence and follow-ups committed with candidate. Keep PR NOT READY for full audit and unresolved coverage/reviewer evidence. Releasing ownership for orchestrator; no merge, publish, or closure."
  "2026-10-04T12:10:49.717Z",codex-sol,"Review round 1: adding the real malformed NODE_PATH file regression for the canonical launcher filesystem-error refusal; canonical template remains byte-identical. Generated managed pm-github distribution is clone-local/ignored and its exact install command and read-only zero-case preview remain documented. Valid upstream apply-path findings are scoped out of this consumer PR, not fixed or write-tested. Full audit and existing coverage blockers remain open."
  "2026-10-04T12:15:28.646Z",codex-sol,"Review corrections validated: full locked release gate 208/208 zero skips, duplication 0/8790 lines, all 5 packed scenarios green, launcher linked 8/8. Published pm-github apply-path concerns are valid but outside consumer scope; follow-up pm-slack-standup-bhg0 remains open. Audit and coverage blockers preserved. Releasing claim for orchestrator."
notes[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T21:11:37.684Z",codex,"2026-09-28 UTC candidate evidence: exact dev pins @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.28, pm-ops 2026.9.28, pm-changelog 2026.9.25; published pm-ops prepare template copied byte-for-byte. npm run release:check passed 206/206 tests, zero failures/skips in test summary, 81 documented declarations across 11 files, 0/8756 duplicated lines across 26 sources, zero production npm audit vulnerabilities, changelog date and publish attestation checks. Packed acceptance passed npm-current, bun-current, npm-minimum, bun-minimum, npm-global-current; current host 2026.9.28 and minimum 2026.8.20. Strict PM health passes with one stale-item and one historical provenance advisory. Coverage gate measured only index.ts: lines 90.44%, branches 88.38%, functions 91.79%; whole-source 100/100/100/100 remains blocked by pm-slack-standup-7t31. Three incident items closed after live release run 36230459197; regenerated CHANGELOG.md with pm-changelog."
  "2026-09-28T21:17:04.791Z",codex,"2026-09-28 UTC exact-head CI on 642a802 failed Node 22 and 26 changelog:check while local Node 24 passed. Cause was an incomplete local tag set: local checkout lacked v2026.09.26, but GitHub CI fetched it and correctly generated an Unreleased section for the three post-tag incident closures. Fetched tags from origin, regenerated CHANGELOG.md with pm-changelog, and rechecked against the complete tag set. This is a local evidence-quality correction, not a Node-version runtime failure; new commit and exact-head gate are required."
  "2026-09-28T21:24:16.474Z",codex,"2026-09-28 review/CI corrections: CodeRabbit correctly found stale description and actual_result in open coverage blocker pm-slack-standup-7t31; updated both via pm update. Greptile correctly found the publication validation version was not the first containing fix; git tag --contains and published releases prove protected-PR ordering first shipped v2026.08.10, OIDC and pre-mutation guard first shipped v2026.08.28. Corrected fixed_version and release fields; regenerate full-tag changelog. Greptile also requested a real damaged-install branch test; added directory-without-package.json and dangling-link consumer checkouts. Node 26 CI 5f74369 failed a ratio of 2.11ms and 6.87ms in a performance test; retain the adversarial 200k input, 2s absolute bound, and exact 400k-backslash quoting assertion while removing the noisy millisecond-scale ratio. Focused Node 26 tests pass. New full release gate and exact-head CI/reviews required."
  "2026-09-28T21:38:31.976Z",codex,"2026-09-28 Greptile exact-head 33bedcc review found the single cold timing check did not meet the repository performance-test guidance. Reworked the same 200k-backslash adversarial test with 10 warm-ups, a 2s absolute bound, 25-invocation batches across three trials, median 20k-versus-200k input growth under 30x, and exact 400k-backslash output assertion. Focused local Node 22 and 26 suites each pass 42/42; full Node 26 release:check passes 207/207, five packed npm/Bun scenarios, 81 documented declarations, 0/8755 duplicate lines, and zero production audit vulnerabilities. This is candidate evidence; new exact-head CI and bot reviews remain required."
  "2026-10-02T21:14:38.022Z",pi-grok,"Refused CodeRabbit's request to restore the literal-prefix notes and append a second correction. pm item notes supports --edit and --delete, so notes are current-state fields, not an append-only log. History events 6-8 already preserve the prefixed text, the removal, and the corrected restoration without rewriting earlier JSONL lines. Restoring author=codex,text= into the current projection would undo that correction."
